       "source": "UniProtKB",
       "id": "Q9EPM5"
      }
     ],
     "value": "May link the dystrophin-associated glycoprotein complex (DAPC) to intracellular desmin (DES) filaments. Interacts with DES and DTNA"
    }
   ],
